# Copy this file to .env.local for local development (.env.local is gitignored).
#
# Google Street View Static API key, used by the Gallery to render before/after
# Street View imagery. Vite inlines VITE_* values into the client bundle, so this
# key is publicly visible in the deployed site. Treat it as public-but-restricted:
# Restrict to the Street View Static API only. Set the production key as a GitHub 
# Actions secret, not here.
VITE_GOOGLE_STREET_VIEW_API_KEY=
